{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112002535486-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112003016\"/><p>行動中拘捕一批女子。</p><p>旺角區警員聯同相關部門人員根據線報及深入調查，昨日（11日）在區內展開代號「冠軍」的跨部門反非法入境者及非法勞工行動，突擊巡查區內多個地點。</p><p>行動中，14名內地女子及4名外籍女子，年齡介乎19至48歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」被捕。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，部分被捕人稍後將交由相關部門跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:41:30.640785+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T16:25:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:34:52.006536+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:34:52.006536+00:00","content_hash":"1505fb4c87f2fe2dff4e1f8dc79245f4f1da79b7a77d3bcbe6fef481b9f70eb1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}